"description" = "A manifestation journal that remembers what you actually do. Vela writes a chapter about the life you want from your own words, and each chapter ends with one real step for today. Take it, leave your proof, and the next chapter weaves in what you did.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n• Say what you're calling in, in your own words, and how it will feel\n• Read or listen to Chapter I, written from those words\n• Choose one real step: 2 minutes, 15 minutes, a brave one, or your own\n• Cross it, then leave one honest sentence of proof\n• Your proof is woven into the next chapter, highlighted in gold\n• Each proof becomes a star, and your sky only grows\n\nAlready done something toward it? Add it when you set up, and Chapter I weaves it in, in gold.\n\nEVERY STEP BECOMES A STAR\nWhen you chart a proof, a new star is born in a constellation drawn for your dream. Tap any star to reread its day, or share it as an image. At the seventh star the season is complete: you name your sky, and Season 2 begins.\n\nSEASONS, NOT STREAKS\nA season is seven chapters, from The First Glimpse to Becoming, and each one is shaped by what actually happened. There are no scores and nothing resets. The nights you show up are kept, rest nights never count against you, and you can pause your sky for up to 30 nights.\n\nTHE MEMORY BOOK\nEvery chapter, step and proof is kept in order on the Arc tab. Reread any chapter whenever you like.\n\nLISTEN\n• Narration in a voice already on your iPhone, with the speed you choose\n• Original soundscapes made for Vela, playing softly under each chapter\n• A sleep timer: 10, 20 or 30 minutes, or the end of the chapter\n• Unlimited listens, always, even offline\n\nRITUALS THAT SERVE YOUR STORY\n• Script: writing prompts linked to your story\n• 3·6·9: one phrase, written 18 times through the day\n• Gratitude: three good things\n• Your lines: identity lines born from your own proof\n• Scenes: a private board of the life you're building, with your proof photos added for you\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nEverything is written and stored on your iPhone. No account, no servers, no tracking. Export a private backup file whenever you like. Optional reminders arrive at your ritual time and keep your words off the Lock Screen unless you choose otherwise.\n\nVELA PLUS\nYour story, the whole loop, your sky, unlimited listens and backup stay free. Plus adds room around them:\n• More than one dream at a time\n• 3 extra soundscapes: Rain on Glass, Hearth and Dawn\n• Every affirmation area, not only your own\n• Unlimited Scenes\n\nVela Plus is a monthly or yearly subscription, or a one-time Lifetime purchase. No weekly plans or credits.\n\nVela is a practice for imagination and small, real actions. It doesn't promise outcomes and isn't medical, financial or professional advice.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period; manage or cancel any time in your Apple Account settings. Lifetime is a one-time purchase.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://dhaxor.github.io/vela/privacy";
