"whatsNew" = "Vela 1.1, Night Atlas, is our biggest update yet.\n\n• Your own night sky: every proof you chart is born as a star. At the seventh, you name your constellation and begin a new season.\n• Seasons of seven chapters, from The First Glimpse to Becoming, each woven from what you did, with your proof highlighted in gold.\n• Choose your step: 2 minutes, 15 minutes, brave or your own, with an optional if-then.\n• Already done something? Add it at setup and Chapter I weaves it in, in gold.\n• The Memory Book keeps every chapter, step and proof to reread.\n• A new reader: pick a voice, speed and text size, set a sleep timer, and listen over original soundscapes.\n• Rituals: Script, 3·6·9, Gratitude, Your lines and Scenes.\n• Progress that never resets, with rest nights and a pause.\n• Private backup: export and import a file.\n\nAlso: a calmer design and many fixes. Everything you've already written comes with you.";
